{"4537390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ploomies", "steam_appid": 4537390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ball is a chicken, you drive a bumper car, and the field is a pinball!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An online multiplayer for 4-6 players. Drop into wild mini-games where the the ball is a chicken. Compete in chicken rugby, human pinball, king of the hill, egg races and more! Every match is short, chaotic and stupidly fun.<strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537390/extras/19bf88e3284e4e6574829d9ba6d35955.poster.avif?t=1788173864\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537390/extras/19bf88e3284e4e6574829d9ba6d35955.webm?t=1788173864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537390/extras/19bf88e3284e4e6574829d9ba6d35955.mp4?t=1788173864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mini-games for everyone</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chicken Rugby</strong>: score a touchdown with a panicked chicken. What could go wrong? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Human Pinball</strong>: you ARE the ball. Bounce, score, win. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>King of the Hill</strong>: last one standing on top of the chaos wins. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egg Races</strong>: pure speed and dirty tactics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New modes</strong> added every season!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537390/extras/2149eeddde3db376a42d285215443f2e.poster.avif?t=1788173864\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537390/extras/2149eeddde3db376a42d285215443f2e.webm?t=1788173864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537390/extras/2149eeddde3db376a42d285215443f2e.mp4?t=1788173864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Casual and ranked matches!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casual:</strong> quick matches, have fun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranked:</strong>  climb the ladder, prove who is actually good </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Public matchmaking:</strong> find players from around the world </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Private lobbies:</strong> invite friends, set your own rules </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537390/extras/fc64b42635efb813c68d78bfe80049c6.poster.avif?t=1788173864\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537390/extras/fc64b42635efb813c68d78bfe80049c6.webm?t=1788173864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537390/extras/fc64b42635efb813c68d78bfe80049c6.mp4?t=1788173864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made by Sixtyfour Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Spanish indie studio obsessed with one thing: making competitive games that don't take themselves seriously.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ball is a chicken, you drive a bumper car, and the field is a pinball!</stro